        "category": "summary",
        "title": "Summary",
        "text": "A crafted OPC UA request makes the OPC UA server of C80 controllers with firmware 3.0 up to 3.3.x stop answering until the controller restarts. Machine control continues; data collection over OPC UA stops."
      },
